### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create deposit
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create transfer
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create withdrawal
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 25,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### Validation error (bad amount + currency + account)
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "bad",
  "toAccount": "also-bad",
  "amount": -1.999,
  "currency": "FAKE",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### List all transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions

### Filter by account
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Filter by type
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?type=transfer

### Filter by date range
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Combined filters
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=withdrawal&from=2024-01-01&to=2030-12-31

### Get transaction by id (replace with a real id)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/{{transactionId}}

### Account balance
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Account summary (Task 4 Option A)
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/summary
